# com.coraltele.aiorchestrator locks

- Docs (LLM call centre restart): `docs/README.md` → `docs/01_*.md` … `docs/06_APPLICATION_FLOW.md`
- Brain: conversation **graph** is law (`docs/03_BRAIN_AND_GRAPH.md`)
- Live behaviour: turn machine (`docs/04_LIVE_TURN_MACHINE.md`)
- Kernel: **Go** only; no Python/Java media kernel
- Live PCM: in-memory only; no Kafka/Redis for audio
- Edge: FreeSWITCH `mod_audio_stream` is a dumb PCM pipe
- Vendors: behind ports/gateways (Sarvam baseline)
- Tools: transfer/hangup = arm → final TTS → execute once
- Scope: LLM voice call centre — no caption/translator SKUs in this programme
- Never commit `.agent/secrets.local.json` or paste credentials into docs/commits
